-- Phase 2 alignment
--  * removes enum values the identity migration added that are not in the schema
--  * reshapes the admin tables to Backend PRD section 24 / A.12 (the tables are empty)
--  * adds users.first_failed_login_at and admins.first_failed_login_at (failed-login window)
--  * adds categories and prohibited_item_rules (reference data)
--  * makes the device push token unique only among live rows
-- The first part is generated by `prisma migrate diff`; partial unique indexes that
-- Prisma cannot express already exist and are left untouched.

